# Node version for the WebUI.
#
# The DOM test environment (`jsdom`) pulls `html-encoding-sniffer@7`, whose `engines` field is
# `^22.13.0 || >=24.0.0`. Below that floor the package is CommonJS but its dependency
# `@exodus/bytes` is ESM-only, and only Node >= 22.13 (or >= 24) can `require()` an ES module.
# On Node 20 the loader throws `ERR_REQUIRE_ESM`, so every `.dom.test.ts(x)` file dies *before*
# its tests run — 24 files and ~100 tests silently absent, with the suite still reporting the
# remaining files as passed.
#
# Keep this in sync with `engines.node` in package.json.
22.13.0
